Design references
-----------------

Some rules whose details are not visible in play follow the behaviour of
CypherCore (https://github.com/CypherCore/CypherCore, GPL-3.0), a World of
Warcraft server emulator, as a design choice. No CypherCore source code is
included. See docs/PROVENANCE.md for which rules and which CypherCore commit.
